 "quotes": [{"text": "To be out there with someone like Maddy [Green], who has that experience and was able to calm me down out there and create a partnership was a pretty cool moment,", "form": "direct", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "Plimmer", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e4"]},
            {"text": "When I started [opening the innings] I got to do it with Suzie Bates and tried to learn as much as I could from her and now it's an opportunity for young players to try and step up.", "form": "direct", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "Plimmer", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e6"]},
            {"text": "Hopefully that [innings] can push me forward and get some more confidence as well.", "form": "direct", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "Plimmer", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e1"]},
            {"text": "her introduction to the international game had been challenging", "form": "indirect", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "she", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e1"]},
            {"text": "Having to learn in international cricket especially when I came in, I definitely didn't feel like I was ready at that point. For me it was mental and trying to build confidence when you haven't done it before was the toughest thing to do.", "form": "direct", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "she", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e1"]},
            {"text": "There have been a lot of tough conversations and work behind the scenes to get me to where this is.", "form": "direct", "speaker": "e1", "speaker_as_printed": "she", "verb": "said", "channel": "interview", "about": ["e1"]}],
